The capture side uses the SLF4J API (`org.slf4j.LoggerFactory`) and casts to a Logback `ch.qos.logback.classic.Logger`, so any production AUDIT logging must go through SLF4J (`LoggerFactory.getLogger("AUDIT")`) at INFO or above to be captured.

